{"unit_id":"BoyangL04__dsh-task-notify#card-zh","repo":"BoyangL04/dsh-task-notify","commit":"cfe793d05cd5e8eb228fc40ce1baecc14c2543b6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-task-notify 是面向 Harness 网页客户端的会话通知插件，在 shell.overlay 中显示应用内提示，并可发送桌面通知。它监听会话状态，在一轮运行结束后延迟确认，或在授权、提问、计划确认等交互等待用户时提醒；通知可点击打开对应会话。提示支持中英文、自动消失和手动关闭，适合希望及时发现任务完成或会话阻塞的 Harness 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-11","client.js:352-594"]}
{"unit_id":"BoyangL04__dsh-task-notify#card-en","repo":"BoyangL04/dsh-task-notify","commit":"cfe793d05cd5e8eb228fc40ce1baecc14c2543b6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Notifies Harness users when a turn finishes or awaits input. The web client shows overlay toasts and desktop alerts for completions, approvals, questions, and plan reviews. Clicking opens the session; alerts expire automatically and support Chinese and English.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-11","client.js:352-594"]}
