{"unit_id":"BoyangL04__dsh-task-notify#feature-1","repo":"BoyangL04/dsh-task-notify","commit":"cfe793d05cd5e8eb228fc40ce1baecc14c2543b6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-task-notify 的功能「completion」：会话完成提醒：当会话从运行转为空闲并持续一段时间后，插件显示提示并发送桌面通知；再次运行会取消待发提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:421-446"]}
