{"unit_id":"BoyangL04__dsh-task-notify#feature-3","repo":"BoyangL04/dsh-task-notify","commit":"cfe793d05cd5e8eb228fc40ce1baecc14c2543b6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-task-notify 的功能「toast」：应用内提示与会话跳转：提示显示标题和上下文，自动过期或可手动关闭；点击提示或桌面通知会打开对应会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:388-419","client.js:539-594"]}
